  "title": "WMIC Removed from Windows 11? Use These PowerShell Commands Instead",
  "slug": "wmic-removed-windows-11-powershell",
  "description": "WMIC is being retired from modern Windows versions. This UniTech LK guide shows PowerShell CIM commands that replace common WMIC commands for checking BIOS serial numbers, computer manufacturer and model, CPU, RAM and disk information.",
  "publication_date": "2026-08-19T09:30:00+03:00",
